From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: leds: qcom-lpg: describe the PMXR2230 PWM block

PMXR2230 shares the reviewed PM8350C channel/output layout, but uses a
standalone compatible so an older driver cannot bypass subtype validation.
Board routing and emitted colors remain separate physical acceptance gates.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/leds-qcom-lpg.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/leds-qcom-lpg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/leds-qcom-lpg.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/leds-qcom-lpg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/leds-qcom-lpg.yaml
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,pmi8994-lpg
           - qcom,pmi8998-lpg
           - qcom,pmk8550-pwm
+          - qcom,pmxr2230-pwm
       - items:
           - enum:
               - qcom,pm6150l-lpg
